# _mutants/ holds DELIBERATELY-BROKEN receipt documents generated by
# _b9_cc0002_fifth_mutant.py as the CC-0002 fifth-mutant review. Three of the four are invalid
# receipts by construction (a sentinel bound to a different unit, a sentinel that violates the id
# pattern, and an artifact block asserting a file that is not on disk).
#
# They are NOT committed on purpose. Any gate that sweeps receipt-shaped JSON under
# command-center/ would find them and correctly go red, which would red-block main for a fixture
# rather than a defect. The generating script IS committed and is deterministic, so the mutants are
# reproducible on demand:
#
#     python command-center/p2-next/_b9_cc0002_fifth_mutant.py
#
# This is the same reasoning that keeps p2-wave's own mutants under a _tmp path.
_mutants/
